# a format 30 project, from before the master filter (format 31: four master values after the slot's, project.c
# SET_HDR30): saved by that build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Master FX's slot set (its
# knob 3 and an extra too, the values format 30 added: they must land where they were), the EQ's low 80, the comp 50,
# the level 110.
# Run by a format 30 build (7cf3e0d): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v30.xy
wait 300
bpm 113
mst color 3
mst camount 70
mst ctone 40
mst ck3 33
mst cx2 5
mst cmix 90
mst lo 80
mst comp 50
mst level 110
wait 40
projsave 1 v30_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v30.bin
